---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Asset Owners & Operators | InSpectiv Labs"
  description="Monitor mines, infrastructure, energy assets and urban developments for ground movement, deformation and emerging stability risks."
>
  {/* 1. Hero / Introduction */}
  <section class="relative pt-40 pb-32 bg-[#000f2c] text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30">
      <img
        src="/images/insar_mine.jpeg"
        alt="Asset Monitoring"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-sm md:text-base font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-cyan-400 mb-4">
        FOR ASSET OWNERS & OPERATORS
      </h2>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light mb-8 leading-tight tracking-wide"
      >
        Monitor the Ground <span class="font-bold">Beneath Your Assets</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="text-xl text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto"
      >
        Whether you operate a mine, construction or infrastructure project, energy facility, utility network, or urban development, ground movement can create operational, structural and financial risks. InSpectiv uses satellite-based InSAR analytics to continuously monitor ground deformation across your assets—helping you identify emerging movement, understand its progression and act before risks escalate.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 2. Built for Your Assets */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          BUILT FOR YOUR ASSETS
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-hard-hat text-3xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Mining & Resources</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Monitor mine sites, waste dumps, tailings areas, slopes and surrounding ground for subsidence, settlement and deformation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-building-house text-3xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Infrastructure & Construction</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Track ground movement around roads, railways, bridges, tunnels, buildings and active construction sites to identify settlement and structural-risk indicators.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bxs-bolt text-3xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Energy & Utilities</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Monitor power plants, pipelines, transmission corridors, renewable-energy sites and other critical assets for ground deformation and instability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-buildings text-3xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Urban Development</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Assess subsidence and ground movement across large development areas, buildings and surrounding infrastructure to support safer and more resilient urban growth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 3. Key Capabilities */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          KEY CAPABILITIES
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-map-alt text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Monitor large areas remotely without relying solely on ground-based instrumentation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-time-five text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Understand deformation over time through historical and continuous monitoring.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-target-lock text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Identify emerging hotspots and prioritise areas requiring inspection or intervention.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 4. The Challenge & 5. Our Solution */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-32 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 relative">
        <div
          class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gray-200 -translate-x-1/2"
        >
        </div>

        {/* Challenge */}
        <div class="lg:pr-12 flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
            THE CHALLENGE
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            As an asset owner or operator, you need to know whether the ground beneath and around your assets is stable.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            But deformation can be gradual, widespread and difficult to detect through periodic site inspections alone. Large or remote assets can be particularly challenging to monitor consistently.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg font-medium italic border-l-4 border-[#1d4ed8] pl-6">
            The key question is: Is the asset stable today, and is its condition changing?
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* Solution */}
        <div
          class="lg:pl-12 flex flex-col mt-12 lg:mt-0 pt-12 lg:pt-0 border-t lg:border-t-0 border-gray-200"
        >
          <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
            OUR SOLUTION
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            InSpectiv turns repeated satellite radar observations into actionable ground-deformation intelligence.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
            We help you understand where movement is occurring, how much it is moving, how that movement has evolved, and where further attention may be required.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 6. What We Monitor */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-32 bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          WHAT WE MONITOR
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        {/* Mining & Resources */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <i class="bx bx-hard-hat text-2xl text-cyan-600"></i>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide">Mining & Resources</h4>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Mine-site subsidence
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Pit and slope deformation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Waste-dump movement
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Tailings-area deformation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Surrounding ground movement
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {/* Infrastructure & Construction */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <i class="bx bx-building-house text-2xl text-cyan-600"></i>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide">Infrastructure & Construction</h4>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Settlement around structures
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Ground movement around excavation
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Roads, railways and bridges
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Tunnels and major construction sites
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Deformation surrounding critical infrastructure
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {/* Energy & Utilities */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <i class="bx bxs-bolt text-2xl text-cyan-600"></i>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide">Energy & Utilities</h4>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Pipeline corridors
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Power-generation facilities
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Transmission infrastructure
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Solar and wind developments
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Ground movement around critical utility assets
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        {/* Urban Development */}
        <div class="bg-white p-8 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <i class="bx bx-buildings text-2xl text-cyan-600"></i>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide">Urban Development</h4>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Urban subsidence
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Building and infrastructure surroundings
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Large development sites
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Ground settlement
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-600 text-sm font-light">
              <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span> Changes in deformation patterns across urban areas
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 7. How It Works (Timeline) */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-32 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-24">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          HOW IT WORKS
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-x-8 gap-y-16">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-1.png" alt="Satellite Data Acquisition" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-1" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-1"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-1">01</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Satellite Data<br class="hidden lg:block" />Acquisition
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              We acquire historical and/or regularly updated satellite radar data covering your area of interest.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-2.png" alt="InSAR Processing" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-2" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-2"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-2">02</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              InSAR<br class="hidden lg:block" />Processing
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Multiple radar observations are processed to detect subtle changes in the Earth's surface.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-3.png" alt="Deformation Analysis" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-3" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-3"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-3">03</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Deformation<br class="hidden lg:block" />Analysis
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              We analyse deformation magnitude, location, spatial patterns and movement trends.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-4.png" alt="Risk Alerts & Reporting" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-4" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-4"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-4">04</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Risk Alerts &<br class="hidden lg:block" />Reporting
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Significant deformation zones and changing trends are highlighted through maps, visualisations and reports.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-5.png" alt="Informed Decision-Making" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-5" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-5"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-5">05</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Informed<br class="hidden lg:block" />Decision-Making
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Your teams can prioritise inspections, investigations, maintenance and risk-mitigation actions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img src="/images/step-6.png" alt="Continuous Monitoring" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-6"></div>
            <span class="text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-6">06</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Continuous<br class="hidden lg:block" />Monitoring
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Regular satellite observations allow you to track how your asset and its surrounding environment change over time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 8. Sample Insight */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          SAMPLE INSIGHT
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl text-gray-800 font-light">
          Deformation Map + Time-Series Analysis
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/insar_interferogram.png" alt="InSAR Deformation Map" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
          <div class="p-4 text-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Deformation Map</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <img src="/images/time_series.png" alt="Time-Series Graph" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
          <div class="p-4 text-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Time-Series Analysis</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base font-light leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-3xl">
        See where deformation is occurring and how it is changing over time, helping your team distinguish stable areas from locations requiring further investigation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 9. Business Impact */}
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-[#000f2c] text-white">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl text-cyan-400 font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          BUSINESS IMPACT
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-2xl text-white font-light">
          Turn Ground Movement into Proactive Asset Intelligence
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-300 text-sm font-light">Identify potential issues earlier</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-300 text-sm font-light">Prioritise physical inspections</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-300 text-sm font-light">Monitor large and remote assets efficiently</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-300 text-sm font-light">Reduce dependence on extensive site surveys</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-white/10 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400/30 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-400 text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
